{"availability":"available","full":"TilmanGriesel/chipper","name":"chipper","description":"✨ AI interface for tinkerers (Ollama, Haystack RAG, Python)","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":485,"forks":48,"created":"2024-12-22T17:54:13Z","updated":"2026-05-19T18:31:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chipper.tilmangriesel.com/","topics":["agent","agentic-ai","deepseek","deepseek-chat","deepseek-r1","embedding","hugging-face","huggingface","llama3","llm","llm-inference","ollama","ollama-api","ollama-client","ollama-gui","phi4","rag","retrival-augmented-generation"],"demo":"https://demo.chipper.tilmangriesel.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.428Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.428Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.428Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.428Z","stars":485,"forks":48}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Chipper provides a web interface, CLI, and a modular, hackable, and lightweight architecture for RAG pipelines, document splitting, web scraping, and query workflows, enhancing generative AI models with advanced information retrieval capabilities. It can also function as a proxy between an Ollama client, such as Enchanted or Open WebUI, and an Ollama instance. Built with Haystack, Ollama, Hugging Face, Docker, TailwindCSS, and ElasticSearch, it runs as a fully containerized service.","This project started as a personal tool to help my girlfriend with her book, using local RAG and LLMs to explore characters and creative ideas while keeping her work private and off cloud services like ChatGPT. What began as a few handy scripts soon grew into a fully dockerized, extensible service and along the way, it became a labor of love. Now, I'm excited to share it with the world.","If you find Chipper useful, leaving a star ⭐ would be lovely and will help others discover Chipper too."],"features":["Installation and Setup","Local & Cloud Model Support - Run models locally with Ollama or connect to remote models via the Hugging Face API.","ElasticSearch Integration - Store and retrieve vectorized data efficiently with scalable indexing.","Document Chunking - Process and split documents into structured segments.","Web Scraping - Extract and index content from web pages."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TilmanGriesel/chipper/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ff23c73f45eb1e9ffa8b9d4ca6f21becad1a6c7cfad52e5af83d4da4d88f1b55","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.514Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.514Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Chipper provides a web interface, CLI, and a modular, hackable, and lightweight architecture for RAG pipelines, document splitting, web scraping, and query workflows, enhancing generative AI models with advanced information retrieval capabilities. It can also function as a proxy between an Ollama client, such as Enchanted or Open WebUI, and an Ollama instance. Built with Haystack, Ollama, Hugging Face, Docker, TailwindCSS, and ElasticSearch, it runs as a fully containerized service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TilmanGriesel/chipper/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ff23c73f45eb1e9ffa8b9d4ca6f21becad1a6c7cfad52e5af83d4da4d88f1b55","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TilmanGriesel/chipper/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.514Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-19T18:31:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TilmanGriesel/chipper/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.515Z","hash":"ff23c73f45eb1e9ffa8b9d4ca6f21becad1a6c7cfad52e5af83d4da4d88f1b55","originalBytes":9599,"storedBytes":9599,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["chipper","ollama","web","api","interface","project","features","models","cli","rag","support","docker","enchanted","model","proxy","setup","acknowledgments","client","demos","document","face","fully","